            "value" : "%1$@ will know your Sphinx account as %2$@: your @jamie in its tribes runs as %3$@, and Peel opens its apps as %4$@. Link only if you just asked for this there."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ conocerá tu cuenta de Sphinx como %2$@: tu @jamie en sus tribus funciona como %3$@, y Peel abre sus apps como %4$@. Vincula solo si acabas de pedirlo allí."
